The [[Shell Totem]] is an [[weapon]] (although it deals no damage) obtained by combining the [[Wooden Sword]] and [[Shiny Shell]], which are both common items available in the shop for all characters. Every once in a while, if the character is healthy, it will give 1 {{icon/empower}}, which can be very powerful with enough different weapons. It instead heals the character when they are low on health.

The [[Shell Totem]] takes a significant amount of stamina, despite dealing no damage, so it is highly-preferred to place [[Holy]] items next to it, which can substantially reduce this burden, leaving room for more weapons to utilize the {{icon/empower}}.

Although the [[Shell Totem]] is a [[weapon]] and doesn't deal damage, it isn't simply a weapon with 0 damage, it has no attack at all, and so it can't be buffed with effects like the [[Whetstone]] to deal nonzero damage.
